If :attr:`input` is a vector of size :math:`n` and :attr:`vec2` is a vector of
size :math:`m`, then :attr:`out` must be a matrix of size :math:`(n \times m)`.

.. note:: This function does not :ref:`broadcast <broadcasting-semantics>`.

